["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasUninstall", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Element has each `to` Artifact uninstalled (removed from position for use) from it during a LifecycleScopeType period. To express the Agent doing the uninstall, link this relationship as the `from` in `performedBy`.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
